			<p class="textblock__subtitle" data-font-size-pc="24" data-font-size-mo="16">Our mission is to help people do the impossible. <br /><br />We take inspiration from what people want to accomplish in their lives and work to create products that empower in new ways. This is what drives our innovation forward.<br /><br />Find your opportunity to do what can't be done at Samsung.</p>
			
			
			
			
			
